{"seq":2,"slug":"gtp-robot-fleet-task-allocation","title":"货到人拣选与机器人车队任务分配调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/asrs-goods-to-person-robotics/gtp-robot-fleet-task-allocation","wordCount":2911,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"货到人拣选与机器人车队任务分配调度\">货到人拣选与机器人车队任务分配调度</h1><p>一台料箱机器人把货架从 A 区顶到 3 号拣选站，拣货员扫走两件商品，货架再被顶回储位——这在峰值下每分钟重复上千次。仓库吞吐不取决于单台机器人跑多快，而取决于<strong>调度器如何把「哪张货架、去哪个站、走哪条路、何时回库、何时充电」在几百个并发任务上排好队</strong>。本文拆解货到人（Goods-to-Person, GTP）模式下任务分配与车队调度的真实机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>先钉死四个术语：**货到人（GTP）**是机器承担全部行走、人固定取件投格的作业范式；<strong>任务分配</strong>决定「哪张货架由哪台机器人、在什么时刻服务哪个站点」，是在制品的静态绑定；<strong>车队调度</strong>在其上叠加路径、交通管制与资源预约，是时序的动态裁决；<strong>排他资源</strong>指同一时刻只能由一个机器人占用的物理单元——拣选站缓存位、单行巷道、提升机通道、充电桩。一切调度冲突都源于对排他资源的竞争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"货到人模式与车队形态\">货到人模式与车队形态</h2><p>GTP 的核心思想是<strong>把「人到货」翻转成「货到人」</strong>：拣货员固定在拣选站不动，由机器人搬运载具（货架、料箱、托盘）到站。这一翻转把行走时间（传统人到货模式中占 50%–70% 的工时）转移给机器。Wurman 等在 Amazon Kiva 系统的论文中给出规模化论证：几百台协同自主车辆可把拣选站人均效率提升到人到货模式的 2–4 倍（来源：Wurman, D&#39;Andrea, Mountz, <em>AI Magazine</em> 29(1), 2008）。</p>\n<p>仓储自动化里存在三类形近但调度语义不同的 GTP 车队：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>车队形态</th>\n<th>搬运对象</th>\n<th>导航方式</th>\n<th>调度关键约束</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>货架搬运机器人（顶升式 AGV/AMR）</td>\n<td>整货架/货岛</td>\n<td>二维码地面、SLAM</td>\n<td>货架—站点匹配、地面拥堵、顶升对接</td>\n<td>Amazon Kiva 谱系、Geek+、Hai Robotics</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>料箱/托盘机器人（AS-RS 结合）</td>\n<td>单个料箱</td>\n<td>轨道/货架巷道</td>\n<td>提升机通道占用、深位取放</td>\n<td>AutoStore、Ocado Hive、Dematic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站间 AMR（拣选辅助）</td>\n<td>订单料车</td>\n<td>激光 SLAM</td>\n<td>人机混行安全、站点排队</td>\n<td>Locus Robotics、6 River Systems</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>无论哪一类，调度器对外只暴露三件事：<strong>任务分配</strong>（哪个机器人执行哪个搬运）、<strong>路径与交通管制</strong>（如何无碰撞到达目标）、<strong>资源预约</strong>（拣选站、提升机、充电桩、巷道的时序）。前者决定「谁做」，后者决定「怎么走」，二者必须联合求解——单独最优的分配可能在路径上制造死锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"任务分配-从订单到机器人\">任务分配：从订单到机器人</h2><p>任务分配的输入是拣选站对货架的<strong>需求序列</strong>，输出是「机器人—货架—站点—时刻」四元绑定，通常分三层，逐层收紧约束。</p>\n<p><strong>第一层：订单分批（order batching）。</strong> 把多张订单合成波次，让同一货架的一次搬运服务尽可能多的订单行，目标是最小化货架总行程与重复搬运。这是 NP-hard 的集合划分问题，工程上用<strong>种子算法</strong>：选一张种子订单，把与其货位重叠度高的订单聚进来，直到达到站点缓存上限。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层：货架—站点指派。</strong> 每个待搬运货架要绑到一个拣选站；若某货架能同时满足多个站的需求，就产生竞争。设货架集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span></span>、站点集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>，代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是「机器人到货架距离 + 货架到站点距离 + 站点排队预期」的加权，则指派是标准线性分配问题：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min \\sum_{i \\in I}\\sum_{j \\in J} c_{ij}\\, x_{ij} \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_{j} x_{ij} = 1,\\; \\sum_{i} x_{ij} \\le 1,\\; x_{ij} \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9305em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>等号侧是「每个站必须有货可拣」，不等号侧是「一个货架同时只能去一个站」。满匹配时可用匈牙利算法（Kuhn, <em>Naval Research Logistics Quarterly</em> 2(1–2), 1955）求全局最优，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；工程实现多用 Jonker-Volgenant 变体，常数因子更小且能处理非方阵。几百个货架 × 几十个站的规模，JV 单次求解只需毫秒级，<strong>实时重算可行</strong>——这是调度器能对波次变化反应的前提。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层：机器人—任务绑定（robot dispatching）。</strong> 把任务派给具体机器人，几乎不用全局最优，而用<strong>增广代价的贪心</strong>或<strong>拍卖机制</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"dispatch(tasks, robots):&#10;  for task in tasks_by_priority():          # 加急/超时任务优先&#10;    best = argmin over idle robots r of cost(r, task)&#10;    cost(r, task) = dist(r, shelf)            # 空驶距离&#10;                  + dist(shelf, station)      # 载货距离&#10;                  + queue_wait(station)       # 站点拥堵惩罚&#10;                  - reuse_bonus(r)            # 机器人已在附近则奖励&#10;    assign(best, task)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>dispatch(tasks, robots):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for task in tasks_by_priority():          # 加急/超时任务优先</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    best = argmin over idle robots r of cost(r, task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cost(r, task) = dist(r, shelf)            # 空驶距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  + dist(shelf, station)      # 载货距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  + queue_wait(station)       # 站点拥堵惩罚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  - reuse_bonus(r)            # 机器人已在附近则奖励</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assign(best, task)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>queue_wait</code> 是防止「所有机器人涌向最忙的站」的负反馈项：站点排队越长，吸引力越低，负载自动摊平。漏掉它，调度器会数学上最优地把整支车队堵在同一站点门口——这是模拟里最常见的失败模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"车队调度与交通管制\">车队调度与交通管制</h2><p>分配完成后，N 个机器人要同时在有限的物理空间里移动，这是一个 <strong>多机器人路径规划（Multi-Agent Path Finding, MAPF）</strong> 问题：为每个机器人找一条从起点到终点的无碰撞路径，允许等待但禁止穿越冲突边。MAPF 是 NP-hard 的，最优解算法（如 CBS，Conflict-Based Search，Sharon 等, <em>Artificial Intelligence</em> 2015）在几百个智能体规模下无法实时求解，因此工业系统普遍放弃全局最优，转而用<strong>分层解耦</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[上层: 货架-站点指派&lt;br/&gt;JV 匈牙利 全局最优] --&gt; B[中层: 车道级路由&lt;br/&gt;时间窗 A*/Dijkstra&lt;br/&gt;预约表避让]&#10;    B --&gt; C[下层: 单机运动规划&lt;br/&gt;局部避障/加减速]&#10;    C --&gt; D[执行: PLC/驱动器&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级闭环]&#10;    D --&gt; E[状态回报: 位姿/电量/任务&lt;br/&gt;周期上报调度器]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    B -.-&gt;|死锁检测| F[交通管制: 封路/单行/优先级&lt;br/&gt;解除环路等待]&#10;    F --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[上层: 货架-站点指派&lt;br/&gt;JV 匈牙利 全局最优] --&gt; B[中层: 车道级路由&lt;br/&gt;时间窗 A*/Dijkstra&lt;br/&gt;预约表避让]\n    B --&gt; C[下层: 单机运动规划&lt;br/&gt;局部避障/加减速]\n    C --&gt; D[执行: PLC/驱动器&lt;br/&gt;毫秒级闭环]\n    D --&gt; E[状态回报: 位姿/电量/任务&lt;br/&gt;周期上报调度器]\n    E --&gt; A\n    B -.-&gt;|死锁检测| F[交通管制: 封路/单行/优先级&lt;br/&gt;解除环路等待]\n    F --&gt; B</pre><p>中层的核心机制是<strong>时空预约表（reservation table）</strong>：机器人申请「在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 占用节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 或边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>」，冲突则等待或绕行。预约表把连续空间离散成图，使死锁可检测——死锁的充分条件是存在<strong>环路等待</strong>（A 等 B 占据的节点、B 等 C、……回到 A）。解法有三类：<strong>封路</strong>（节点设为不可用，迫使绕行）、<strong>单行化</strong>（双向巷道临时设为单向）、<strong>优先级让行</strong>。VDA 5050 把「谁先走」抽象成订单优先级与节点/边状态，并允许车队端下发**区域动作（zone action）**临时管制区域（来源：VDA5050 v3.0.0，<a href=\"https://github.com/VDA5050/VDA5050\">https://github.com/VDA5050/VDA5050</a> ）。</p>\n<p>人机混行仓库还有一层<strong>安全约束必须先于效率约束</strong>：无人驾驶工业车辆的安全要求由 ISO 3691-4 规定（来源：ISO 3691-4:2020, Industrial trucks — Safety requirements — Part 4: Driverless industrial trucks and their systems），要求速度随感知距离动态限制、安全激光雷达扫描区内的减速—停止可验证。调度的优先级与避让半径都必须在此红线之内，安全停车永远否决效率优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"站点协同-充电与异常处理\">站点协同、充电与异常处理</h2><p>车队调度的难点往往不在「跑得快」，而在<strong>资源协同</strong>与<strong>故障收敛</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>拣选站平衡。</strong> 站点是排他资源，一个站同时只服务一个货架（缓存位除外）。吞吐上限由最慢环节决定：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>TP</mtext><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>机器人供给率</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 拣选站处理率</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> 储位回库率</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{TP}_{\\max} = \\min(\\text{机器人供给率},\\ \\text{拣选站处理率},\\ \\text{储位回库率})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">TP</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">机器人供给率</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">拣选站处理率</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">储位回库率</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当某站拣货员卡住，上游货架队列迅速积压，调度器必须支持<strong>任务抢占与改派</strong>——把已派出的货架改投空闲站。</p>\n<p><strong>机会充电（opportunity charging）。</strong> 锂电池机器人不能等耗尽再充，否则峰值时集体趴窝。调度器把充电当作一类<strong>低价任务</strong>：电量低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 且空闲时派往最近充电桩，高于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{high}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 则回岗待命。阈值是调度参数——太低会中断任务，太高会让机器人频繁往返空驶；经验起点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{low} \\approx 20\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20%</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{high} \\approx 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">hi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，再用仿真按任务强度标定。</p>\n<p><strong>异常收敛。</strong> 机器人失联、顶升失败、货架卡住是常态而非例外。可靠调度器遵循「<strong>任务状态机 + 幂等重试</strong>」范式：任务先进入派发态等待回执，超时重发，收到已处理回执后幂等丢弃重复；失败任务区分「可重试」与「不可重试」，前者回到任务池重新分配。这套语义与 VDA 5050 <code>RETRIABLE</code> 动作状态、MQTT 的 QoS 分级（<a href=\"https://mqtt.org/\">https://mqtt.org/</a> ）一脉相承——<strong>传输层不承诺恰好一次，把去重与重试收进上层状态机</strong>。状态机与幂等机制的完整展开见本 hub 的 <a href=\"../wcs-architecture-equipment-model/task-state-machine-idempotent-dispatch\">任务状态机、指令下发确认与幂等重试</a>；搬运任务的路径预约与分拣格口路由共享同一套时空离散化模型，见 <a href=\"../conveyor-sortation-routing/conveyor-topology-accumulation-flow\">输送线拓扑与积放流控制</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>充电与死锁的耦合</strong>是易被忽视的坑：把充电桩全塞进仓库角落，低电量机器人会形成单行充电排队巷道，与主通道交叉处极易环路等待。规划时就要把充电桩<strong>可达性</strong>当作一等布局约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键指标与常见瓶颈\">关键指标与常见瓶颈</h2><p>衡量 GTP 车队调度好坏，要同时盯住吞吐、利用率与队列三类指标，单看任何一个都会误判：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>健康区间</th>\n<th>恶化信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拣选站吞吐</td>\n<td>每站每小时拣选行数</td>\n<td>依站点设计 300–1000 行/时</td>\n<td>站点饥饿（等货）或积压（等拣）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器人利用率</td>\n<td>有效搬运时间 / 在岗时间</td>\n<td>60%–80%</td>\n<td>&lt;50% 空驶过多；&gt;85% 无弹性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均任务时延</td>\n<td>任务生成到完成的时长</td>\n<td>与波次强度匹配</td>\n<td>尾部 P95 远高于中位数 → 拥堵/死锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>站点缓存占用</td>\n<td>缓存位被占比例</td>\n<td>稳定不涨</td>\n<td>持续上涨 → 供给失衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空驶里程占比</td>\n<td>空车行驶 / 总里程</td>\n<td>&lt;40%</td>\n<td>过高 → 分配未做就近匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>用利特尔法则（Little&#39;s Law）可快速估算稳态车队需求：在制品数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、到达率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>、平均完成时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda \\times W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若波次强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span> 任务/时、平均周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟，则稳态需约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>600</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>60</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 600 \\times \\frac{2}{60} = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">60</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 台机器人在制。这是<strong>下界</strong>——未算空驶、充电、故障与峰值波动，实际规模通常再留 20%–40% 余量，并用离散事件仿真验证峰值不塌陷。</p>\n<p>常见瓶颈按出现频率排序：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>站点缓存不足</strong>导致机器人无法卸货而占道——最高频的塌陷点；</li>\n<li><strong>单行巷道冲突</strong>导致排队连锁，一个卡顿沿通道反向传导；</li>\n<li><strong>充电桩布局不合理</strong>导致低电量车与主通道交叉形成环路等待；</li>\n<li><strong>分配器缺少排队惩罚</strong>导致车队全部聚集到最忙的站；</li>\n<li><strong>任务粒度过粗</strong>（一次搬整货架只服务一张订单）导致空驶率虚高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些瓶颈绝大多数不是算法不够聪明，而是<strong>约束建模时漏掉了某个物理资源</strong>——调度的本质是把所有排他资源的时序在同一模型里对齐，漏一个，它就会在峰值时成为全场瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GTP 车队调度可以浓缩成一条决策链：<strong>订单分批 → 货架—站点指派（全局最优线性分配）→ 机器人—任务绑定（带拥堵惩罚的贪心/拍卖）→ 路径与交通管制（预约表 + 死锁解除）→ 充电与异常收敛（低价任务 + 幂等状态机）</strong>。全局最优只用在货架—站点这一层，其余各层用足够好的启发式换实时性；安全约束（ISO 3691-4）始终否决效率优化。把每一类排他资源——站点、巷道、提升机、充电桩——都显式建模进调度器，比追求更精巧的算法更能决定仓库在峰值日能否稳住吞吐。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"货到人拣选与机器人车队任务分配调度","id":"货到人拣选与机器人车队任务分配调度"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"货到人模式与车队形态","id":"货到人模式与车队形态"},{"level":2,"text":"任务分配：从订单到机器人","id":"任务分配-从订单到机器人"},{"level":2,"text":"车队调度与交通管制","id":"车队调度与交通管制"},{"level":2,"text":"站点协同、充电与异常处理","id":"站点协同-充电与异常处理"},{"level":2,"text":"关键指标与常见瓶颈","id":"关键指标与常见瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"立体库结构、穿梭车/提升机与拣选站模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/asrs-goods-to-person-robotics/asrs-shuttle-lift-station-model"},"next":{"title":"AMR 电量/存储生命周期与安全合规（ISO 3691-4）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/warehouse-control-system-sortation-automation-asrs/asrs-goods-to-person-robotics/amr-charging-safety-compliance"}}